===Etymology 2===
Perhaps related to {{m|nl|kopen|t=to buy, trade}}, possibly from {{der|nl|ofs|kāp||purchase}}, or otherwise from {{der|nl|la|capio|t=I seize}}. Attested before {{m|nl|kapen}}; originally only attested in the phrase {{m|nl|ter kaap varen}}.

